    <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://purl.org/spar/amo/"/>
    <skos:note xml:lang="en">By means of the property chain defined, the assertion that links a claim to the relative rebuttal is automatically inferred starting from the high-level description of an argument (realized through the sub-properties of 'involves' and their inverse properties).</skos:note>
